WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.570
Let's talk about something super happy

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:05.807
which is this highly
anticipated Friends reunion.

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:06.863
Ooh yeah.

00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:10.380
And then it gets pushed
because of this crisis

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.956
we're all going through.

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:12.789
Yeah.

00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:14.940
So, I know that that must
have felt a little bit like

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.030
oh, we're gonna do this now, but wait, no,

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.910
now we're not gonna do it for a while.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.380
Do you know when you're doing it?

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:25.380
We have something on the
books for us to do it.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:27.850
At some point in August,

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:28.683
and we'll see,

00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:31.270
I mean, we're all still
waiting for guidelines

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:35.340
for shooting things, so, hopefully,

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.800
yeah, that would be great.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.960
You know what would
really piss people off?

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.060
If you guys did it but it was on Zoom.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.370
So the highly anticipated
all of you getting together

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.910
was you guys on Zoom.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.860
Still not in the same room.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.480
You're not in the same room

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.540
and you can't really hear
each other that well.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.950
And then you say, well, there it is.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.308
Goodbye, America.

00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.890
(Lisa laughs)

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.640
Come on, that'd be a fun prank.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.650
That would be great.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:03.483
That would be so good.

00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:07.250
And then freezing, it's like
I'll never forget the time

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.056
you were insane and you.

00:01:09.056 --> 00:01:11.560
(Conan laughing)

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:12.393
Yeah.

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:13.226
Remember?

00:01:13.226 --> 00:01:15.240
Remember, Jennifer, that
time that you did that thing

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.870
we never forgave you for which was

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:17.930
and then you all freeze.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.740
And then you come back
and you're all laughing.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.920
That's fantastic.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:22.820
I would love that.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:24.336
Just do that, please.

00:01:24.336 --> 00:01:27.590
I'm good at thinking of
ideas that ruin things.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:31.000
And that's what I think
would be a great prank.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.067
Great prank on America.
Those are the most fun.

